WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.272
KATE BISHOP
Can I tell you a secret?

00:00:03.609 --> 00:00:05.476
I'm working with an Avenger.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.067
HAILEE STEINFELD
Oh my gosh, whoa, we are right in front of

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:14.642
Grand Central Station in
beautiful New York City.

00:00:14.692 --> 00:00:18.079
Day 4 on Hawkeye. I mean, it is already...

00:00:21.043 --> 00:00:25.470
Everything happened very quickly.
Archery lessons, training in LA

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.942
on the stunt side of things,
hand-to-hand combat. I love that this job

00:00:28.992 --> 00:00:33.239
left me no excuse but to get to a place
where I could come here and be

00:00:33.289 --> 00:00:35.978
shown something and I would
be able to pick up on it quickly.

00:00:36.028 --> 00:00:37.942
BERT
The kind of hook for us was bringing a

00:00:37.992 --> 00:00:42.760
female superhero, that it's not about
being superhuman, it's about being

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:46.603
super skilled,
and funny as anything.

00:00:46.654 --> 00:00:47.752
RHYS THOMAS
We knew we wanted to contrast

00:00:47.802 --> 00:00:50.510
her with Clint. You know, they're the
classic buddy cop sort of energy,

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.321
of these two divergent
personalities, kind of, meeting.

00:00:53.371 --> 00:00:54.429
KATE BISHOP
It's pretty cool to me.

00:00:54.479 --> 00:00:55.825
CLINT BARTON
People are trying to kill us.

00:00:57.831 --> 00:00:58.624
KATE BISHOP
Actually, it's pretty bad

00:00:58.674 --> 00:00:59.374
when you think about it.

00:00:59.424 --> 00:01:01.101
JEREMY RENNER
Hailee Steinfeld is just wonderful.

00:01:01.151 --> 00:01:02.916
She's a very, very talented actress.

00:01:03.487 --> 00:01:04.487
[Grunt]

00:01:05.424 --> 00:01:06.231
KATE BISHOP
Didn't realize we were supposed to

00:01:06.281 --> 00:01:06.934
bring guns.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.833
JEREMY RENNER
I begrudgingly, sort of, have her as a

00:01:08.883 --> 00:01:11.169
partner and then our
friendship grows through it,

00:01:11.219 --> 00:01:13.188
and a lot of wonderful
and fun things transpire.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.145
[Laughing]

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:15.677
ELEANOR BISHOP
So, Kate is helping you

00:01:15.727 --> 00:01:18.097
with an Avengers level threat?

00:01:20.305 --> 00:01:21.663
KATE BISHOP
He's my partner.

00:01:21.713 --> 00:01:22.551
CLINT BARTON
That's kind of a stretch.

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:25.184
VERA FARMIGA
She's really adept at digging deep

00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:29.749
and mining and just adding so much
dimension. What Hailee's done with

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.073
this character, I think fans
are just gonna eat her up.

00:01:33.124 --> 00:01:34.598
KATE BISHOP
We're saving the holidays.

00:01:34.648 --> 00:01:35.770
HAILEE STEINFELD
I'm just so excited to be a

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:39.676
part of the MCU, I've had an amazing time
and I just feel very lucky to be here

00:01:39.726 --> 00:01:41.704
right now, and I'm
excited to see what happens.

00:01:42.843 --> 00:01:43.957
KATE BISHOP
Holy sh—

00:01:44.757 --> 00:01:46.626
There are arrows
more dangerous than that one?

